flowchart TB
    Source["候選儲存庫／PR head"]
    Trust["受信任基準<br/>程式、政策、工具鎖定與 RoE"]

    subgraph Evaluator["受信任評估端：本機或 GitHub runner"]
        Run["run_security.py<br/>supervisor／限額 worker"]
        Scan["G1／G2<br/>來源／SBOM／OSV 與機密掃描"]
        Oracle["AUTH：容器外 oracle<br/>32 個授權案例與副作用查核"]
        Decision["確定性政策判定<br/>ALLOW／BLOCK，故障即阻擋"]
        Report["run-bound report.json<br/>摘要綁定與清理結果"]
        Run --> Scan --> Oracle --> Decision --> Report
    end

    Isolation["隔離 FastAPI＋PostgreSQL 容器<br/>無網路、非 root、唯讀根目錄<br/>內部使用 Unix socket／合成資料"]

    Source -->|"候選作為資料"| Run
    Trust --> Run
    Oracle <-->|"HTTP bridge／獨立 DB 查核"| Isolation

    subgraph ModelPath["獨立模型審查路徑：目前僅固定合成案例"]
        direction TB
        Cases["review-cases.json<br/>盲測請求，不含標準答案"]
        Gateway["model_review.py<br/>Gateway；呼叫前持久化預留<br/>有界循序呼叫"]
        Live["Gemini／Claude Sonnet<br/>adapter／v2 真實推論已驗收<br/>v3 配對待憑證"]
        GLM["GLM adapter<br/>離線回歸；真實連線暫停"]
        Score["嚴格輸出驗證＋本機評分<br/>比較、分歧與失敗分母"]
        Advisory["模型報告僅供參考<br/>COMPLETE／INCOMPLETE"]
        Cases --> Gateway
        Gateway --> Live --> Score
        Gateway -.-> GLM
        Score --> Advisory
    end

    %% 僅對齊兩條獨立路徑，沒有資料交換。
    Source ~~~ Cases

    CI["GitHub Actions<br/>精確 head 獨立核准＋正式必要檢查"]
    Signed["獨立 runner 簽署 ZIP 摘要<br/>GitHub artifact attestation"]
    Rules["main Ruleset：已啟用、無 bypass<br/>目前必要來源為共用 Actions App"]
    Publisher["專用 trusted publisher：程式已備妥<br/>App／主機／Ruleset 綁定尚未部署"]
    Report -->|"評估工作保存證據"| CI
    CI --> Signed
    CI -->|"來源核對與核准均必要"| Rules
    Signed -.->|"待受控主機驗證簽章與來源"| Publisher
    Publisher -.->|"未啟用的 epsilon/trusted-merge"| Rules

    classDef implemented fill:#e8f4ff,stroke:#28629b,color:#153958;
    classDef isolated fill:#edf8ef,stroke:#3a8051,color:#21472e;
    classDef pending fill:#fff4dc,stroke:#a67822,stroke-dasharray:5 5,color:#664708;
    class Run,Scan,Oracle,Decision,Report,Cases,Gateway,Live,Score,Advisory,CI,Signed,Rules implemented;
    class Isolation isolated;
    class GLM,Publisher pending;
